comments.body:
@swissalpine's workaround should be sufficient for utilizing AAPS on Unihertz Jelly2. Thanks 👏

Workaround:  Find 'Smart assistant' - 'App blocker' menu. Remove the 'Background cleanup' (or any other) restrictions.

This way AAPS behaviour is as expected and BT connection kept open even in lock screen and when the screen is turned off.
